# Treeguard Duo (CR 115.1, 611.2a, 608.2h): "target creature you control gains vigilance and gets +X/+X, where X is the number of creatures
# you control." Bot1 controls an Ornithopter and the Duo (X = 2); Bot2's Ornithopter and Memnite are not counted. The target must be a creature
# Bot1 controls: Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot1's Mox Jet (not a creature) are refused.
# Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2, flying) becomes a 2/4 with vigilance, flying stays; the Duo itself is untouched (3/4). On Bot1's next turn the pump and vigilance are gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Treeguard Duo
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x18

